<title>USA: StreamLogic names executives.</title>
<headline>StreamLogic names executives.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>StreamLogic Corp said Monday that it has named Steve Dalton president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Dalton was formerly vice president of engineering at the company.</p>
<p>The company also said it appointed Mark Glickman, chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In the past 10 years, Glickman, a CPA and attorney, has held executive positions at Ridge Computers, Visual Technology and Ironstone Group.</p>
<p>Information on who these executives replace was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
